DESCRIPTION:The Jazz Area Combos present a series of small group performances featuring a range of jazz and contemporary music. With works arranged or composed by students and faculty\, the concert offers a thoughtful look at the collaborative and creative efforts within the Jazz Area. \nEditor’s note: This event is a community submission.
