DESCRIPTION:May Storytime at the Library! \nJoin School Psychology student Paula for fun and engaging storytime sessions in the Children’s Library. \nLocation: UO Portland Library\, 2nd Floor – Room 201 (Children’s Library) \nAll are welcome! \nEditor’s note: This event is a community submission.
