SUMMARY:Mr. Ben at Willamette Garage
DESCRIPTION:Join Portland family musician Mr. Ben for a joyful weekly singalong full of music\, movement\, dancing\, and community connection for little kids and their grownups. \nDesigned for babies\, toddlers\, preschoolers\, and early elementary-aged children\, these interactive performances encourage participation\, imagination\, kindness\, and inclusivity through music. Expect playful folk-rock-inspired songs\, silly moments\, and lots of opportunities to sing and move together. \nFree event; tips greatly appreciated.
URL:https://pdxparent.com/event-single/mr-ben-at-willamette-garage/
LOCATION:Willamette Garage in West Linn
CATEGORIES:Kids Calendar,Music
