SUMMARY:B-Side Records & Vintage Open Mic: All Ages\, All Formats
DESCRIPTION:Free! Weekly OPEN MIC for all ages and all formats.  \nYouth musicians are encouraged to attend! \nMusicians\, vocalists\, comedians\, poetry\, spoken word\, full bands\, storytellers\, and more! Join us for the B-Side Records & Vintage Open Mic at 6:30pm on Wednesdays every week. We are located in downtown Milwaukie at 10801 SE Main Street. Close to the MAX and across the street from public parking and TriMet’s downtown transit station. \nSign up starts at 6:00pm. Full PA and soundboard available to plug into. House drum kit available upon request. Full bands can be easily accomodated but please call ahead to arrange soundcheck. Soundchecks are performed from 5:30-6:00pm. Double check our website for any variations to the weekly schedule. \nOpen mic gives performers an opportunity to get comfortable on the stage in our performance venue\, The Riff. Booking for The Riff is done several months in advance but booking inquiries can be submitted through our website: bsiderecordsvintage.com  A full calendar of events can also be found there if you’d like to see The Riff in action before performing! \nB-Side Records & Vintage is a family-operated small business in Milwaukie\, OR. B-Side and The Riff are safe\, welcoming spaces. Thank you for supporting local music! \nEditor’s note: This event is a community submission.
URL:https://pdxparent.com/event-single/b-side-records-vintage-open-mic-all-ages-all-formats/2026-05-27/
LOCATION:B-Side Records & Vintage: Milwaukie\, 10801 SE Main St\, Milwaukie\, OR\, 97222\, United States
CATEGORIES:Kids Calendar,Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://pdxparent.com/wp-content/uploads/dont-miss-out.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="B-Side Records &amp%3B Vintage%3A Milwaukie":MAILTO:info@bsiderecordsvintage.com
END:VEVENT
